    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/pixel-ebook-store/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Pixel Ebook Store theme is a sleek and modern solution designed for authors, publishers, bookstores, libraries, book clubs, online bookshops, and eBook retailers seeking a professional digital presence. Whether you run an independent bookstore, specialty shop, digital reading platform, or subscription-based book service, this theme provides an intuitive and visually engaging platform to showcase and sell eBooks, audiobooks, bestsellers, limited editions, comics, academic publications, and novels. Ideal for self-published authors, audiobook creators, and book reviewers, it features customizable layouts, dynamic product displays, immersive reading previews, advanced filtering, and category-based organization. With WooCommerce plugin integration, you can sell physical and digital books, offer book bundles, manage inventory, and provide subscription services effortlessly. This responsive, SEO-friendly, and translation-ready theme enhances engagement with social media integration, interactive showcases, and promotional features for book signings, author events, and virtual book fairs. Its built-in blogging capabilities are perfect for literary discussions, genre highlights, author spotlights, and reading recommendations, while multilingual functionality ensures global accessibility. Whether you manage a digital bookstore, literary café, comic shop, or online reading community, Pixel Ebook Store combines elegant design, eCommerce tools, and user-friendly navigation to deliver a powerful platform for book lovers and sellers alike."
    },
